cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use NovaFabric in your research or tooling, please cite it as below."
title: "NovaFabric: Replayable AI Infrastructure"
abstract: >-
  NovaFabric is a self-hosted, open-source CLI toolkit that captures, replays,
  diffs, and audits AI agent and model runs as portable, redacted, signed
  evidence capsules. It runs in the user's own infrastructure, from a laptop
  to a cluster. It is built around five primitives — Asset Registry,
  Run Capsule, Replay, Lineage, and Evidence Bundle — and supports four replay
  modes (exact, mocked, semantic, forensic). No accounts and no telemetry; data
  stays on the user's machine.
type: software
